stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: A dispatch scan resumes a durable wait
accDescr: An order progresses through label preparation to a callback wait, then an authenticated scan permits an idempotent shipped-state update, with timeout recovery as an alternate transition.
[*] --> Label
Label: Invoke label-printing integration
Label --> Waiting
Waiting: Standard workflow waits for callback
Waiting --> Shipped: Valid dispatch token returned
Waiting --> Recovery: Timeout or failure
Shipped: Idempotent shipped-state update
Shipped --> [*]
Recovery: Investigate and recover order
